1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Subtitles by quiet_owl

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:10,400
Subtitles from OpenSubtitles

3
00:00:27,285 --> 00:00:30,452
There's someone on the road.

4
00:00:30,874 --> 00:00:33,577
Wait, I forgot my coat.

5
00:00:35,063 --> 00:00:37,356
Close it, then.

6
00:01:02,175 --> 00:01:04,950
You said that last month.

7
00:01:06,339 --> 00:01:09,487
Did you feed the dog?

8
00:01:09,873 --> 00:01:13,556
Pass me the salt, please.

9
00:01:15,034 --> 00:01:17,369
The garage roof leaks.

10
00:01:19,318 --> 00:01:22,292
Twice. He still looks hungry.

11
00:01:47,246 --> 00:01:50,306
On the table, next to the lamp.

12
00:01:51,429 --> 00:01:55,414
Is your brother coming tonight?

13
00:02:24,896 --> 00:02:28,385
I found the letter in the attic.

14
00:02:28,731 --> 00:02:31,693
The train leaves at seven.

15
00:02:32,601 --> 00:02:35,671
You always say that.

16
00:02:37,788 --> 00:02:40,918
I told you the bridge was closed.

17
00:02:43,156 --> 00:02:46,866
He said he would call after work.

18
00:02:48,069 --> 00:02:51,555
Ask Dr.Brandt, not me.

19
00:03:11,724 --> 00:03:14,802
I'll fix it on Sunday.

20
00:03:16,557 --> 00:03:20,494
I can't sleep with the window open.

21
00:03:20,661 --> 00:03:24,209
We need to leave before it gets dark.

22
00:03:52,736 --> 00:03:56,422
It's all on gardenhelp.org, she said.

23
00:03:57,085 --> 00:04:00,167
Then set an alarm.

24
00:04:01,819 --> 00:04:04,590
It costs 4.50 a kilo.

25
00:04:05,627 --> 00:04:08,148
The soup is too hot.

26
00:04:09,613 --> 00:04:11,912
It's raining again.

27
00:04:12,742 --> 00:04:15,713
Stop the car!

28
00:04:17,123 --> 00:04:19,187
Read it to me.

29
00:04:21,232 --> 00:04:24,932
Then we take the long road.

30
00:04:25,448 --> 00:04:27,594
Who wrote it?

31
00:04:29,851 --> 00:04:33,576
Write this down: www.dunmore-rentals.com.

32
00:04:45,142 --> 00:04:47,486
What is it?

33
00:04:53,084 --> 00:04:57,084
If this story affected you, find support at
www.helpline-example.org.uk

34
00:04:57,484 --> 00:05:01,484
Captions: Lantern Media Access

